# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Sri Havyaka Web Automation – Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# FRONTEND (set in Vercel dashboard under "Environment Variables"):
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The public URL of your Ubuntu backend (accessible from the internet
# or your local network, depending on deployment).
#
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://YOUR_UBUNTU_IP_OR_HOSTNAME:8000
#
# OPTIONAL – only needed for local dev proxy (next.config.ts rewrites):
# When NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL is not set, Next.js proxies /api/* to this URL.
#
# BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8000
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BACKEND (stored in SQLite settings table via the UI – not in .env):
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Website credentials and URL are entered through the Settings page.
# They are stored in the local SQLite database ONLY.
# They are NEVER sent to Vercel or any external service.
#
# Optional overrides for non-default data directory paths:
# DATABASE_PATH=/custom/path/master_reference.db
# IMAGES_ORIGINAL=/custom/path/images/original
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OCR: No API keys required.
# PaddleOCR + EasyOCR + Tesseract are all free and run locally.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
